Looking at stacktraces (when it is possible to get one), and seeing how
broken some argument values are (most notably "this"), and considering
calls come from javascript, I suspect a problem with xptcinvoke
(xpcom/reflect/xptcall/src/md/unix/xptcinvoke_linux_alpha.cpp).

As alpha is not a release architecture, and as I have very limited
knowledge of the alpha assembler code, I'll leave this investigation to
willing alpha porters that would like iceweasel to work on alpha.

Cheers,

Mike




